  "notes": "A natural early-game Gulf client for port security, counter-drone and Hormuz-escort work. Context 2026: struck by Iranian missiles and drones after 28 February 2026 (soldiers and civilians killed) and among the states that struck back; Abraham Accords partner of Israel since 2020; withdrew remaining forces from Yemen on 30 December 2025 after Saudi Arabia demanded the UAE-backed STC leave Hadramawt and Mahra; strained ties with the Somali federal government because of its links to Somaliland and Puntland. Wealthy, with Western, Russian, Chinese and Korean kit side by side.",
